        "role": "user",
        "content": "{\"original_question\":\"I'm considering whether I should start scripting my cooking videos or just go with the flow. What do you think?\",\"task\":{\"question\":\"What are the user's past experiences and preferences regarding scripting or planning their cooking videos?\",\"output_slot\":\"video_planning_history\",\"answer_type\":\"text\",\"inputs\":[],\"execution\":\"retrieval\"},\"grounded_subquestion\":\"What are the user's past experiences and preferences regarding scripting or planning their cooking videos?\",\"request_context\":{\"query_identity\":\"4ac509bb6cc4e26a44ea1f9fcd32ce020de246a7057befac4842b3a26404820d\",\"algorithm_version\":\"dagbt_residual_memory_v2\",\"program_identity\":\"5b03e96af5f35ef802e2bef9616b75866c93e082ebf89a6cfd4f1e95c6ee4170\",\"initial_dag_identity\":\"f91a1c8c4fb2e1d8c70a7b5afa6d6c9ed8fed58d30fc445b0ec65c12ce73f8c2\"},\"variables\":{\"video_planning_history\":{\"type\":\"text\",\"demand\":\"video_planning_history\",\"evidence_semantics\":\"personal_history_summary\",\"scope\":{\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"past\"}}},\"requested_slots\":[\"video_planning_history\"],\"requested_scopes\":{\"video_planning_history\":{\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"past\"}},\"output_contract\":{\"mode\":\"semantic\",\"result_type\":\"text\",\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"current\",\"explanation\":\"semantic\"},\"program_revision\":0,\"rule_binding\":null,\"supported_parents\":{},\"known_observations\":[{\"id\":\"fact_75d2c375af7a7a2e33e6c57f\",\"stance\":\"support\",\"value\":\"The user has a history of disliking rigid formats and structured planning in creative activities. They abandoned writing book reviews because they felt boxed into a format that limited creativity (s3). They lost interest in a book review blog because it became a chore and felt like an obligation (s28-s29). They prefer casual, relaxed settings over rigid formats (s23). They also dabbled in fan fiction but felt it no longer matched their evolving personal style (s13-s14). However, they later resumed blogging about books and found it fulfilling (s36-s38), and hosted a podcast episode with an author (s46-s48). Overall, the user's past experiences show a strong preference for spontaneity and flexibility over rigid planning or scripting, though they have engaged in structured creative activities when they felt authentic.\",\"source_ids\":[\"s29\",\"s23\",\"s38\",\"s36\",\"s37\",\"s3\",\"s13\",\"s46\",\"s14\",\"s47\",\"s48\",\"s28\"],\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"past\",\"parent_versions\":{},\"retract_ids\":[],\"reason\":\"The user explicitly stated they abandoned reviews because they felt 'boxed into a particular format' (s3). They lost interest in a blog because it felt like a 'chore' and 'obligation' (s28-s29). They expressed a preference for 'casual, relaxed settings' over 'rigid formats' (s23). They stopped fan fiction because it no longer matched their style (s13-s14). Later, they resumed blogging and found it fulfilling (s36-s38), and hosted a podcast (s46-s48). These experiences indicate a consistent pattern of disliking rigid structure but engaging in structured activities when they feel authentic.\",\"variable\":\"video_planning_history\",\"revoked\":[],\"semantic_status\":\"model_judgment\"}],\"source_spans\":[[\"s3\",\"d1\",105,457,\"User: I also abandoned the idea of writing reviews. I feel that they tend to limit my creativity, as if I am being boxed into a particular format that doesn't allow my thoughts to flow freely. There's something inherently stifling about structuring my feelings and opinions into a rigid framework, filled with guidelines about what to include or omit. \",\"user\",[53]],[\"s13\",\"d2\",105,381,\"User: I even dabbled in writing fan fiction but felt it didn’t match my personal writing style anymore. I used to enjoy immersing myself in those universes, creating new scenarios and plots that brought my favorite characters to life in ways that hadn’t been explored before. \",\"user\",[40]],[\"s14\",\"d2\",381,768,\"However, as I continued to write, I began to notice a disconnect; my voice seemed to evolve, shifting towards a style that felt more unique to me, and I no longer felt that fan fiction was a suitable canvas. I often found myself reflecting on how fan fiction can be a stepping stone for many writers, allowing them to practice their craft in familiar settings while honing their skills. \",\"user\",[40]],[\"s23\",\"d3\",105,418,\"User: I think I’d prefer more casual, relaxed settings where we can just share our thoughts instead of sticking to rigid formats. It’s about enjoying the literature after all! A setting that feels more like a gathering of friends sharing their interpretations and experiences related to the texts would be ideal. \",\"user\",[96]],[\"s28\",\"d4\",105,455,\"User: I even started a blog about book reviews, but I lost interest quickly. It felt more like a chore at times. I had all these grand ideas about expressing my thoughts on various novels and sharing them with potential readers. However, as the weeks went by, the excitement fizzled out, and it became daunting to even consider writing another post. \",\"user\",[32]],[\"s29\",\"d4\",455,723,\"The joy I initially felt while discussing character arcs and plot twists was overshadowed by the pressure to consistently produce content. It was as if the very act of sharing my passion had turned into an obligation that drained my enthusiasm rather than igniting it.\",\"user\",[32]],[\"s36\",\"d5\",105,355,\"User: For starters, I decided to resume blogging about my favorite books. It had been quite some time since I last put pen to paper, or rather, fingers to keyboard, and the excitement of revisiting this hobby has reignited my passion for literature. \",\"user\",[72]],[\"s37\",\"d5\",355,735,\"I find that every time I write about a book I love, it feels like I’m sharing a piece of my inner world with others, creating a bridge built on shared interests and experiences. After a productive discussion with a fellow book lover, we delved into the rich intricacies of storytelling, exploring how different authors articulate their messages through various styles and genres. \",\"user\",[72]],[\"s38\",\"d5\",735,947,\"Our conversation reminded me of the profound impact that literature can have on our understanding of ourselves and the world around us, which is why I realized how much I missed expressing my thoughts in writing.\",\"user\",[72]],[\"s46\",\"d6\",107,381,\"User: I also hosted a podcast episode featuring an author, where we discussed their inspiration and creative process. This particular episode was not just about the mechanics of writing, but also delved into the personal experiences that shape the author's narrative voice. \",\"user\",[160]],[\"s47\",\"d6\",381,696,\"We touched on the unique ways that different life events, such as love, loss, and even mundane daily occurrences, can spark creativity in unexpected ways. It was also fascinating to hear how the author balanced their personal life with their writing career, which inspired me to reflect on my own creative journey. \",\"user\",[160]],[\"s48\",\"d6\",696,833,\"Overall, it was an enlightening experience for both of us, revealing layers of thought that often go unnoticed in the final written work.\",\"user\",[160]],[\"s50\",\"d6\",846,1217,\"Assistant: That's awesome! It sounds like a captivating dialogue, especially since such discussions often unveil the deeper emotional layers of storytelling. What insights did the author share that resonated with you? The exploration of vulnerability in writing is particularly profound, as it touches on the core of what makes literature impactful—the human experience. \",\"assistant\",[161]],[\"s49\",\"d6\",833,846,\"\\n\\nAssistant:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s51\",\"d6\",1217,1508,\"Many writers grapple with exposing their true selves and allowing their readers to see their struggles and triumphs, which can foster a powerful connection between the two. I'm curious, did the author provide any specific examples or anecdotes that illustrated their views on vulnerability? \",\"assistant\",[161]],[\"s52\",\"d6\",1508,1805,\"It's always enlightening to hear how experienced writers navigate their fears and insecurities, as it not only inspires emerging authors but also reminds seasoned ones that they are not alone in the journey. Such conversations can really ignite a passion for writing within us, don't you think? ])\",\"assistant\",[161]],[\"s53\",\"d7\",0,99,\"Conversation message indices 36–37 (zero-based chronological observation order; not calendar time)\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s54\",\"d7\",99,105,\"User:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s55\",\"d7\",105,313,\"User: I even tried creating art based on book themes; however, it didn’t resonate much with me. Creating art can be an incredibly personal journey, often reflecting the artist's own experiences and emotions. \",\"user\",[36]],[\"s56\",\"d7\",313,638,\"In this instance, despite the intention behind the artwork, it seems that the connection between the themes of the books and your creative expression did not manifest in a way that felt fulfilling. It's fascinating how sometimes the ideas that spark our imagination in one context fail to ignite the same passion in another. \",\"user\",[36]],[\"s57\",\"d7\",638,811,\"Perhaps this experience has highlighted the importance of finding that unique intersection where personal inspiration aligns with the themes that resonate within your heart.\",\"user\",[36]],[\"s58\",\"d7\",811,824,\"\\n\\nAssistant:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s59\",\"d7\",824,1135,\"Assistant: Creative endeavors can be hit or miss sometimes. Each artistic attempt can reveal much about our current state of mind, much like a mirror reflecting our inner thoughts or emotions. Sometimes, even with the best intentions, the results do not align with our expectations, which can be disheartening. \",\"assistant\",[37]],[\"s60\",\"d7\",1135,1395,\"This experience may be an invitation to explore different themes, mediums, or methods that might unlock new avenues for artistic expression. It can also be an opportunity to delve into the reasons why certain subjects resonate more deeply with us than others. \",\"assistant\",[37]],[\"s61\",\"d7\",1395,1766,\"Just as the waves of an ocean ebb and flow, our creative impulses can fluctuate, leading us to discover new interests or forgotten passions. Remember, every piece of art, whether it connects or not, contributes to your growth as an artist. Embracing the journey, along with its ups and downs, is what often leads to the most profound revelations in our creative paths. ])\",\"assistant\",[37]],[\"s62\",\"d8\",0,99,\"Conversation message indices 65–66 (zero-based chronological observation order; not calendar time)\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s63\",\"d8\",99,105,\"User:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s64\",\"d8\",105,476,\"User: I've also decided to stop curating formal book lists. I prefer making personalized recommendations during discussions instead, as this approach allows for a more engaging interaction. It gives me the chance to connect with individuals on a deeper level, discovering their interests in real time rather than presenting them with a static list that may not resonate. \",\"user\",[65]],[\"s65\",\"d8\",476,700,\"There’s a certain joy in tailoring suggestions that align with unique tastes, which often leads to exciting conversations. It feels great to witness the genuine delight when someone finds a book that speaks to them directly.\",\"user\",[65]],[\"s66\",\"d8\",700,713,\"\\n\\nAssistant:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s67\",\"d8\",713,1058,\"Assistant: That sounds much more authentic! Personalized recommendations often resonate better with readers, as they create a sense of personal investment in the recommendations being made. This method not only enhances the reading experience for individuals but also fosters a community that shares a love for literature in a more dynamic way. \",\"assistant\",[66]],[\"s68\",\"d8\",1058,1370,\"It's akin to having a conversation about favorite movies or meals, where the dialogue is alive and vibrant, making the whole encounter more memorable. Additionally, when you consider personal preferences like genre, themes, or even the emotional state of the reader, it enriches the suggestions you can provide. \",\"assistant\",[66]],[\"s69\",\"d8\",1370,1675,\"This collaborative and conversational approach can lead to discovering hidden gems that a more formal list might overlook entirely. In essence, you're not just providing a list of titles; you're inviting a person into a world of stories, characters, and experiences that can genuinely impact their lives. \",\"assistant\",[66]],[\"s70\",\"d8\",1675,1822,\"Overall, this strategy strengthens the bond between you and the reader, elevating the entire literary journey to something much more meaningful. ])\",\"assistant\",[66]],[\"s71\",\"d9\",0,99,\"Conversation message indices 51–52 (zero-based chronological observation order; not calendar time)\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s72\",\"d9\",99,105,\"User:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s73\",\"d9\",105,503,\"User: However, I've realized that I needed to step back from blogging. In recent months, I found that the joy of sharing my thoughts on literature was overshadowed by the pressure to produce content consistently. Each time I sat down to write, instead of feeling excited about a new discovery in a book, I often felt weighed down by expectations, both my own and those I perceived from my readers. \",\"user\",[51]],[\"s74\",\"d9\",503,802,\"It got to the point where I was dreading my writing sessions rather than looking forward to them, which really highlighted how far I had drifted from my original passion. It was a tough decision to make, but stepping back from blogging has allowed me to rediscover that enthusiasm in different ways.\",\"user\",[51]],[\"s75\",\"d9\",802,815,\"\\n\\nAssistant:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s76\",\"d9\",815,1098,\"Assistant: It's important to enjoy the process of engaging with literature, and it sounds like you've made a thoughtful decision based on your experiences. Taking a step back can be a very mature move, especially when it helps rekindle your passion for reading and discussing books. \",\"assistant\",[52]],[\"s77\",\"d9\",1098,1452,\"Focusing on direct interactions with friends can lead to more fulfilling conversations where you can share insights and differing perspectives in a more intimate setting. There's something special about verbal exchanges that can often enhance understanding and enjoyment of literature, as the spontaneity of conversation can lead to unexpected insights. \",\"assistant\",[52]],[\"s78\",\"d9\",1452,1787,\"So what specific topics or books have you been discussing with your friends recently? I'm curious to know what strides you've made in deepening those connections and how they compare to your previous experiences with blogging, as well as any new insights you may have gained about works that you thought you already understood well. ])\",\"assistant\",[52]],[\"s79\",\"d10\",0,101,\"Conversation message indices 108–109 (zero-based chronological observation order; not calendar time)\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s80\",\"d10\",101,107,\"User:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s81\",\"d10\",107,469,\"User: Oh, and I wrote several reviews on products I purchased last month on an e-commerce platform. I was quite eager to share my thoughts because I believe that customer feedback is essential for guiding others in their purchases. Writing reviews allowed me to reflect on my experiences with each item, from the quality to how well they performed in daily use. \",\"user\",[108]],[\"s82\",\"d10\",469,763,\"The process of crafting these reviews was somewhat therapeutic; it helped me articulate my preferences and focus on the details that mattered most to me. Overall, I feel that contributing my insights can assist future buyers in making informed decisions that match their needs and expectations.\",\"user\",[108]],[\"s83\",\"d10\",763,776,\"\\n\\nAssistant:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s84\",\"d10\",776,1145,\"Assistant: That's wonderful to hear! Writing reviews not only helps other consumers make better choices, but it also serves as a valuable tool for companies to improve their products and services. By sharing your experiences, you're contributing to a larger conversation about quality and satisfaction in the marketplace, which can drive improvements across the board. \",\"assistant\",[109]],[\"s85\",\"d10\",1145,1533,\"Moreover, thoughtful reviews can help showcase your distinct tastes and preferences, making it easier for others who share similar criteria to find products that resonate with them. It’s great that you took the time to express your opinions; it's always rewarding to know that you're potentially guiding someone else on their journey to find the right items that can enhance their lives. \",\"assistant\",[109]],[\"s86\",\"d10\",1533,1658,\"Plus, revisiting your own thoughts later may even strengthen your knowledge of your shopping habits or preferences over time.\",\"assistant\",[109]],[\"s87\",\"d11\",0,99,\"Conversation message indices 44–45 (zero-based chronological observation order; not calendar time)\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s88\",\"d11\",99,105,\"User:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s89\",\"d11\",105,409,\"User: Overall, I've learned so much about myself and my preferences in literature. Through this journey, I've not only discovered what genres resonate with me, but I've also gained insights into how certain themes and character arcs can profoundly influence my emotional responses to the stories I read. \",\"user\",[44]],[\"s90\",\"d11\",409,725,\"Each book has offered a new perspective, unveiling layers of my personality that I hadn't fully explored before. Additionally, I've come to appreciate the artistry involved in crafting narratives, from the intricate development of plots to the meticulous selection of language that authors employ to evoke feelings. \",\"user\",[44]],[\"s91\",\"d11\",725,863,\"All these experiences have contributed to a clearer understanding of what truly brings me joy and satisfaction in the realm of literature.\",\"user\",[44]],[\"s92\",\"d11\",863,876,\"\\n\\nAssistant:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s93\",\"d11\",876,1207,\"Assistant: It's wonderful to hear that you've had such a rich and enlightening experience, even if it came with its challenges along the way. The process of self-discovery through literature is incredibly valuable, as stories often hold mirrors to our own lives and can help us navigate our thoughts and emotions more effectively. \",\"assistant\",[45]],[\"s94\",\"d11\",1207,1558,\"Understanding your preferences can lead you to select books that not only entertain but also encourage personal growth and alignment with your values and interests. I admire your resilience in trying to create merchandise, which can be a complex endeavor with various aspects to consider—from design to marketing, and ultimately, audience engagement. \",\"assistant\",[45]],[\"s95\",\"d11\",1558,1822,\"Each step of that journey, whether it resulted in success or not, is part of a larger tapestry that shapes who you are as a reader and creator, allowing you to refine your focus and direct your creative energy towards what genuinely brings you joy and fulfillment.\",\"assistant\",[45]],[\"s96\",\"d12\",0,99,\"Conversation message indices 84–85 (zero-based chronological observation order; not calendar time)\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s97\",\"d12\",99,105,\"User:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s98\",\"d12\",105,505,\"User: I conducted an enlightening interview with a debut author recently, which gave me new insights into the writing process. It was truly inspiring to hear their unique perspective, as they navigated the often daunting world of publishing for the first time. They shared moments of doubt and frustration that resonated deeply with me as someone who has also faced challenges in creative endeavors. \",\"user\",[84]],[\"s99\",\"d12\",505,771,\"The author's passion for storytelling shone through, reminding me of the countless books that have influenced my own life. Listening to their journey made me appreciate the hard work that goes into creating a novel and the emotions that writers pour into their work.\",\"user\",[84]],[\"s100\",\"d12\",771,784,\"\\n\\nAssistant:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s101\",\"d12\",784,1034,\"Assistant: That must have been fascinating! What kind of insights did you gain? It's always enlightening to hear directly from those who are experiencing the trials of writing firsthand, as it can illuminate the complexities of the creative process. \",\"assistant\",[85]],[\"s102\",\"d12\",1034,1379,\"Often, aspiring writers underestimate the importance of perseverance and the emotional toll that writing can take, so hearing their experiences can be quite enlightening for others in similar situations. Moreover, discussing their challenges can also spark invaluable conversations about personal growth and motivation in the face of adversity. \",\"assistant\",[85]],[\"s103\",\"d12\",1379,1613,\"I can imagine that as you listened, you were not only absorbing their stories but also reflecting on your own approaches to storytelling and creativity, which can lead to such profound realizations about one's own journey as a writer.\",\"assistant\",[85]]],\"required_scope\":{\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"past\"},\"rules_completion_required\":false,\"supported_task_outputs\":{},\"personal_response_selection\":true,\"phase\":\"history_evidence\",\"summary_revision_contracts\":{\"video_planning_history\":{\"previous_version\":1,\"eligible_route_ids\":[\"fact_75d2c375af7a7a2e33e6c57f\"],\"required_source_ids\":[\"s29\",\"s23\",\"s38\",\"s36\",\"s37\",\"s3\",\"s13\",\"s46\",\"s14\",\"s47\",\"s48\",\"s28\"]}},\"source_documents\":{\"d1\":{\"doc_id\":\"pers